    "publication_date": "2025-06-27",
    "description": "<p>Model simulations from the Debris-Covered Glacier Melt Model Intercomparison Experiment (DCG-MIP).&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Authors are in alphabetical order. Authors contributed directly to the model simulations.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>There are 14 models (17 model versions), and 9 sites where the models were run.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Details of the experiment are available at: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3134763&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The simulations will become available upon publication of a manuscript.&nbsp;</p>",
